[N 46-47 Maraudon]
[D Forever Shaman 30-60 (Braedyn)\\Maraudon in one run from Desolace: Theramore and the Nijel's Point pickups, the Centaur Pariah, the outer cave (Cavindra, the orange pool, the Nameless Prophet and the Khan spirits), the purple and orange wings, then the inner falls for Celebras and Princess Theradras; back by the Pariah to Nijel's Point, where chapter 55 flies on.]
[GA Alliance]
[OC]|cffffffffLevel check|r  -  this chapter wants level 48 and you arrive at about 46. The pickups need at most 45 (Corruption of Earth and Seed). The outer cave (elites 40-43) and the two wings (bosses 46-48) suit a group at 46; the inner falls are the hard part: Celebras the Cursed 49, Landslide and Rotgrip 50, Princess Theradras 51, all elite. Run it in the order below in one go (outer cave, purple wing, orange wing, inner falls last) and look for a group with a tank and a healer at 48 or more for the inner falls. If the group cannot take the Princess, abandon Corruption of Earth and Seed: one run, never a re-run, and no second visit for a missed drop
[OC]|cffffffffGadgetzan|r  -  you start at Bera Stonehammer where chapter 53 ended; hearth = Gadgetzan and it stays there. Required chapter: one run of Maraudon, |cFFFF0000GROUP 5|r, never a re-run. Five normal quests, 25,900 XP and 1g 40s, plus the run's kills; Shadowshard Fragments and Twisted Evils are grind/luck
[OC]|cffffcc00Carried in:|r Rise of the Silithid (162) and Handle With Care (3022) for Darnassus and Rut'theran, Arcane Runes (3449) for Azshara - all chapter 55; Return to Ironforge (2977) for chapter 57; Into The Temple of Atal'Hakkar (1475) and Cortello's Riddle (624) wait for round 3. Nothing of them is done here
[OC]|cffffcc00Sources:|r quest ids, mob and boss levels and drops come from the Forever DB and the Wowhead Forever tooltips. The DB puts the outer cave (its elites, Cavindra, the orange pool, the Khan spirits) in the open Desolace map and every NPC inside at the instance marker, so the dungeon lines carry no pin. The wings, their bosses and the room order are Classic knowledge, |cffffcc00unverified|r on Forever
At [TAR7823 Bera Stonehammer], |cFFfff8a3Fly to [F Theramore]|r [G51.0,29.3 Tanaris]

[OC]|cffffffffTheramore|r  -  a landing on the way: there is no direct Gadgetzan - Nijel's Point flight
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r Shadowshard Fragments (7070) - 10 Shadowshard Fragments from the Shadowshard Rumblers and Smashers of the outer cave - |cffffcc00grind/luck|r: about 46% a kill, one pass, no farm. Handed in here in Theramore in chapter 57 on the way home
[O]At [TAR4967 Archmage Tervosh], [QA7070 Shadowshard Fragments] (3,450 XP at the hand-in, requires level 39) [G66.4,49.3 Dustwallow Marsh]
At [TAR4321 Baldruc], |cFFfff8a3Fly to [F Nijel's Point]|r [G67.5,51.3 Dustwallow Marsh]

[OC]|cffffffffNijel's Point|r  -  every giver stands within 6 units of the flight master
At [TAR11715 Talendria], [QA7041 Vyletongue Corruption] (5,250 XP, requires level 41: fill her Coated Cerulean Vial at the orange crystal pool, use it on 8 Vylestem Vines inside and kill the Noxxious Scion that comes out of each) [G68.5,8.9 Desolace]
At [TAR13698 Keeper Marandis], [QA7065 Corruption of Earth and Seed] (6,100 XP, requires level 45: slay Princess Theradras). Under 45 (not expected): he will not offer it; skip every Corruption of Earth and Seed line [G63.8,10.7 Desolace]

[OC]|cffffffffThe road south|r  -  Desolace's roads are not in the data: south past Kormek's Hut as in chapter 33, then to the Centaur Pariah's patrol and north-west to Maraudon (the way between them |cffffcc00unverified|r)
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r Twisted Evils (7028) - 25 Theradric Crystal Carvings (Wowhead Forever; the DB text says 15) - |cffffcc00grind/luck|r: about 27% over all droppers inside, about 94 kills for 25. Loot what the run gives, never farm; abandon it after the run if you are short
[O]At [TAR13656 Willow] beside Kormek's Hut, [QA7028 Twisted Evils] (5,250 XP, requires level 41) [G62.2,39.6 Desolace]
At [TAR13717 Centaur Pariah], [QA7067 The Pariah's Instructions] (5,450 XP + 1g 40s, requires level 39: the Amulet of Spirits and the Amulet of Union from Maraudon). He patrols x44-51 y86-88; right-click The Pariah's Instructions to read them [G50.4,86.7 Desolace]
Ride north-west to the Maraudon portal. Keep east of Shadowprey Village (Horde guards, level 55, x24-26 y68-71) and clear of Khan Hratha (42 elite) and his guards north of the cave at 29.6,52.0 [G29.2,61.2 Desolace]

[OC]|cffffffffThe outer cave|r  -  |cFFFF0000GROUP 5|r: form the group before the cave; this part lies outside the portal. Every mob here is elite: north side (x27-30 y53-58) Shadowshard Rumblers and Smashers (40-42), Rock Borers and Rock Worms (40-42); south side (x30-37 y59-68) Ambereye Basilisks and Reavers (40-42), Ambershard Crushers and Destroyers (40-43); the Cursed Centaur (43 rare elite) at 30.4,60.2. Your quests, with the honest label:
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r The Pariah's Instructions (7067) - the Amulet of Spirits from the Nameless Prophet, then the five Khans' gems: Kolk, Gelk and Magra here, Maraudos and Veng inside - |cff66ff66normal|r. A gem's Use puts the five gems in the amulet and makes the Amulet of Union (Classic; |cffffcc00unverified|r). 5,450 XP + 1g 40s at the Pariah
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r Vyletongue Corruption (7041) - heal 8 Vylestem Vines - |cff66ff66normal|r. 5,250 XP at Talendria
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r Legends of Maraudon (7044) - the Celebrian Diamond from Lord Vyletongue and the Celebrian Rod from Noxxion - |cff66ff66normal|r, one kill each (Wowhead reads 37.9% and 42.6% because it counts every kill, quest or not). 3,400 XP at Celebras the Redeemed, who then gives The Scepter of Celebras (7046, 5,700 XP)
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r Corruption of Earth and Seed (7065) - Princess Theradras (51 elite), the last boss - |cff66ff66normal|r. 6,100 XP at Keeper Marandis
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r Seed of Life (7066) - Zaetar's Spirit after the Princess - picked up and carried to Moonglade in round 3
At [TAR13697 Cavindra] (45 elite, friendly) at the cave mouth, [QA7044 Legends of Maraudon] (3,400 XP, requires level 41) [G31.9,63.8 Desolace]
Fill the Coated Cerulean Vial at the Maraudon Orange Crystal Pool [CI17696,1 Filled Cerulean Vial] [G33.2,65.7 Desolace]
[OC]|cffffcc00Spirits:|r the Amulet of Spirits' Use "forces the spirits of the first centaur Khans to manifest"; if a spirit is not standing at its spot, use the amulet there (Classic; |cffffcc00unverified|r). The gems drop from the spirits, not from the living Kolk, Gelk and Magra the DB also places there. No drop rate for the gems is in the data
Kill [TAR13718 The Nameless Prophet] (41 elite) for the [CI17757,1 Amulet of Spirits] (Wowhead 60.87% - one kill) [G28.2,62.4 Desolace]
[O]No Amulet of Spirits from the Prophet: abandon The Pariah's Instructions [QS7067] and skip the gem lines [G28.2,62.4 Desolace]
Kill [TAR12240 Spirit of Kolk] (43 elite) for the [CI17761,1 Gem of the First Khan] [G29.7,60.5 Desolace]
[O]Kill [TAR11777 Shadowshard Rumbler] and [TAR11778 Shadowshard Smasher] on the way north for 10 Shadowshard Fragments [QC7070] (~46% - budget ~22 kills on 15 spawns: only the ones on your path, no farm) [G27.8,55.6 Desolace]
Kill [TAR12239 Spirit of Gelk] (42 elite) for the [CI17762,1 Gem of the Second Kahn] [G29.4,56.9 Desolace]
Kill [TAR12241 Spirit of Magra] (43 elite) for the [CI17763,1 Gem of the Third Kahn] [G35.8,60.4 Desolace]

[OC]|cffffffffMaraudon|r  -  |cFFFF0000GROUP 5|r, one run, never a re-run. Purple wing (bosses 47-48), then orange wing (46-48), then the inner falls (49-51). Which opening is which wing is Classic knowledge, |cffffcc00unverified|r
